  "definition": "Compressed Natural Gas (CNG)",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-04-07",
  "historyNote": "#10753, INTERIM, eff 1-1-15, EXPIRED: 6-30-15 New. #10890, eff 7-16-15; ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.10) (See Revision Note #3 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300)",
